{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kaho.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "公园里的英雄",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kaho.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kaho.first",
    "idolId": "kaho",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我是做这个的——",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "哇！名片！我第一次收到名片！感觉好有大人的样子！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……？那个……你几岁了？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！小宫果穗，12 岁！小学六年级！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶！你是小学生吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！因为我比大家都高，常常被当成大人。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "难怪……我也以为你是高中生呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（确实是个有魅力的孩子，但就在这儿挖一个小学生，合适吗……？）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……可以的话，把这张名片给爸爸妈妈看看，跟他们说被星探搭话了，行吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我觉得你这份精神，能给大家带来梦想。如果可以，请你也想想偶像的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "好，我知道了！诶嘿嘿！爸爸妈妈会不会吓一跳呢——",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……她跑走了。跑得真快。）",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好，今天也精神满满地去找偶像吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "你好——！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哇！……啊，你是昨天的——",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！我是小宫果穗！……哇，这里就是工作的地方！好厉害！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只是普通的办公室而已。话说回来，你今天来了，也就是说……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "啊，对了！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我本来不太了解偶像，回去以后查了很多！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "然后发现，偶像好像能让所有人笑起来！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "这和最喜欢的英雄很像啊——我是这么想的！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "英雄啊……嗯，确实偶像也能让所有人笑起来！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "果然！然后我跟爸爸妈妈说了，他们说要支持我！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "所以，我想试试当偶像！！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……她的眼睛一点都没有躲。）"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（社长说要我自己去挖人……可哪有那么容易碰上。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……哦？那孩子在公园里跑得可真凶。还带着一群小孩。）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（笑声好大。不过看起来像高中生啊……这么大还在公园里玩，挺少见的。）",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "啊哈哈！……哇——！",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（刚才那个笑容，说不定能让很多人打起精神……）",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "……诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "怎么了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你……要不要当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "偶像……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
